{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second part of the Lamborghini Dream Pack is here, introducing the <strong>Lamborghini Miura SV, the Diablo SV-R SuperTrofeo, the Murcielago R-GT &amp; the Revuelto.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lamborghini Miura SV</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Miura SV was the final and most refined evolution of what is considered to be the first true Supercar; Featuring improved handling, a more powerful 385 hp V12, and wider rear tires, the Miura SV was both beautiful &amp; groundbreaking due to its mid-engine design. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lamborghini Diablo SV-R Super Trofeo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A track-only version of the Diablo SV, the SV-R was Lamborghini\u2019s first official race car and the first used for its one-make Super Trofeo series in 1996.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lamborghini Murci\u00e9lago R-GT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed in collaboration with Reiter Engineering and Audi Sport, the R-GT was a race-spec version of the Murci\u00e9lago built for FIA GT and Le Mans.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lamborghini Revuelto</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Revuelto is Lamborghini\u2019s latest hypercar and its first HPEV; combining a new 6.5L naturally aspirated V12 with three electric motors, active rear wing, and dampers \u2013 all duly simulated in AMS2.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3532180?t=1759563126","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532180/1606581712418c67bf923cb0c21d686b26974052/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759563126","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532180/9799cdfe901aec8599c442bf86f4030992838882/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759563126","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532180/9799cdfe901aec8599c442bf86f4030992838882/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759563126","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second part of the Lamborghini Dream Pack is here, introducing the <strong>Lamborghini Miura SV, the Diablo SV-R SuperTrofeo, the Murcielago R-GT &amp; the Revuelto.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lamborghini Miura SV</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Miura SV was the final and most refined evolution of what is considered to be the first true Supercar; Featuring improved handling, a more powerful 385 hp V12, and wider rear tires, the Miura SV was both beautiful &amp; groundbreaking due to its mid-engine design. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lamborghini Diablo SV-R Super Trofeo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A track-only version of the Diablo SV, the SV-R was Lamborghini\u2019s first official race car and the first used for its one-make Super Trofeo series in 1996.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lamborghini Murci\u00e9lago R-GT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed in collaboration with Reiter Engineering and Audi Sport, the R-GT was a race-spec version of the Murci\u00e9lago built for FIA GT and Le Mans.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lamborghini Revuelto</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Revuelto is Lamborghini\u2019s latest hypercar and its first HPEV; combining a new 6.5L naturally aspirated V12 with three electric motors, active rear wing, and dampers \u2013 all duly simulated in AMS2.</p>","developers":["Reiza Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1066890","name":"Automobilista 2"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532180/6fe9fd566d229599a57c25f97b2e302ae7aaec16/header.jpg?t=1759563126","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Automobilista 2 - Lamborghini Dream Pack Pt2","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Automobilista 2 - Lamborghini Dream Pack Pt2 - $9.99 USD","packageid":1246673,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":999}],"title":"Buy Automobilista 2 - Lamborghini Dream Pack Pt2"}],"packages":[1246673],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":0,"final":999,"final_formatted":"$9.99 USD","initial":999,"initial_formatted":""},"ratings":{"dejus":{"rating":"l"},"steam_